// buttonBar: the button bar (the "soft" one of the MessagePad 2x00 era,
// GetRoot().buttons): a strip along one edge of the screen
// (displayParams.buttonBarPosition, or 'none) holding icons of the Extras
// Drawer's parts. It is a protoFinderWindow on the Packages soups' entries
// tagged '_buttonBar, ordered by their sequence: those with a negative
// sequence are the fixed icons, the rest (from 1000) the mobile ones.
// Icons that do not fit show in the Extras Drawer's Unfiled Icons; the
// overview and scroll buttons sit at one end (bbarControls).

